                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's basically Monster Boy like~!\nIt's quite nice and a basic like game.\nI'd say the open world like way of playing it makes it quite different than Monster Boy like experience.\nIt feels a lot more open than what Monster Boy is like.\nYou should definitely play it~!\n\nAlthough, the only negative it has and it's a HUGE one...\nThe combat, the bosses and the minions feel like their own thing, it doesn't combine with the exploration unlike games like Hollow Knight... It's kinda bothersome in that aspect sadly.",
